## Claim
Text: "Hunter Biden (son of US president Joe Biden)  had 25,000 pics of him torturing and raping children under 10 in China on his laptop."
Claim date: October 18, 2020

## Initial Q&A
### Was Joe Biden the sitting President of the United States on October 18, 2020?
Answer: No, Joe Biden was not the sitting President of the United States on October 18, 2020. On that date, he was a presidential candidate running against the incumbent President Donald Trump, as confirmed by the NBC News archive for October 2020, which shows Biden campaigning (e.g., "Trump, Biden tout polar-opposite coronavirus messages in Midwest barnstorm" and "Trump, Biden compete in Midwest battlegrounds"). Biden did not assume the presidency until January 20, 2021.

Source URL: https://www.nbcnews.com/archive/articles/2020/october

### Was there a laptop associated with Hunter Biden that became a subject of public reporting in October 2020?
Answer: Yes, the New York Post published reporting on Hunter Biden's laptop in October 2020. The source confirms that the Post was on "their third day publishing incriminating and emotionally devastating content from Hunter Biden's laptop," and that the laptop contained "a computer camera roll of nearly 25,000 images" loaded with "sexually explicit selfies and porn."

Source URL: https://nationalfile.com/bombshell-ny-post-refuses-to-publish-all-25000-hunter-pics-after-reports-they-include-child-porn/

### Did any forensic examination of a laptop associated with Hunter Biden find 25,000 images depicting child abuse, torture, or rape?
Answer: No forensic examination mentioned in this source confirms the specific claim. The New York Post reported having "nearly 25,000 images" from the laptop, described as including "sexually explicit selfies and porn" along with "snapshots from Biden's childhood and vacations," but there is no mention of any forensic analysis finding images depicting torture, rape of children under 10, or content from China. References to potential "child pornography" on the laptop are characterized as unverified reports (e.g., OAN's Chanel Rion's secondhand claims), not findings from a forensic examination.

Source URL: https://nationalfile.com/bombshell-ny-post-refuses-to-publish-all-25000-hunter-pics-after-reports-they-include-child-porn/

